darts
------------------------------------------
C++ Template Library for Double-Array

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  http://www.chasen.org/~taku/software/darts/

Canonical download:
  http://www.chasen.org/~taku/software/darts/src/darts-0.32.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack darts-0.32-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./darts-0.32-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/darts-0.32-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/darts-0.32-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(darts)
  /usr/include/darts.h
  /usr/libexec/darts/darts.exe
  /usr/libexec/darts/mkdarts.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/darts.README
  /usr/share/doc/darts/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/darts/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/darts/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/darts/README

------------------

